    "insert": "The language in scientific work should be precise, formal, and objective to communicate ideas clearly and credibly. However, in this proposal there are some areas where the language could be further refined. For example avoid using sentences like “I want…”, \"my\", \"myself\"... Instead, consider make it more neutral, objective. I recommend reviewing the text to eliminate subjective language. \n(Content) - sections"
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
